      "sequence": 7,
      "source_line": 37,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "『ウォール街に住む若奥様達の日記シリーズ』",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-13:38:73cd19ae",
      "source_hash": "73cd19ae",
      "sequence": 8,
      "source_line": 38,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "このシリーズは趣味が悪いという人もいる",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-13:39:cfd7202a",
      "source_hash": "cfd7202a",
      "sequence": 9,
      "source_line": 39,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "昔の人達とはいえ<br>他人の日記を盗み読みしているわけだから<br>窃視症を助長するのではないかという考えがある",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>",
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-13:40:a5469270",
      "source_hash": "a5469270",
      "sequence": 10,
      "source_line": 40,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "しかし 僕はそうは思わない",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-13:41:3cdef441",
      "source_hash": "3cdef441",
      "sequence": 11,
      "source_line": 41,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "なぜならこのシリーズに関しては<br>『ペンクラフト』が駆使されているからだ",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-13:43:d75a51dc",
      "source_hash": "d75a51dc",
      "sequence": 12,
      "source_line": 43,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "例え書かれている文字や表現が時とともに<br>廃れてしまっても ペンクラフトを使えばマナと<br>インクを駆使して『意志』を紙に刻みこむことができる",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>",
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-13:47:487d9ee7",
      "source_hash": "487d9ee7",
      "sequence": 13,
      "source_line": 47,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "文字を通じ 光として浮上する 過去の軌跡――",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-13:48:6a0ac438",
      "source_hash": "6a0ac438",
      "sequence": 14,
      "source_line": 48,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "それは時間が経過しても 想いを後世に残したいという<br>意志の表れだと思うのだ",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-13:49:de0f1314",
      "source_hash": "de0f1314",
      "sequence": 15,
      "source_line": 49,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "そんな想いで書かれている日記なら<br>きっと書いた人達もいろんな人に読んでもらいたい<br>という願望がどこかにあったに違いない",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>",
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-13:50:665515cd",
      "source_hash": "665515cd",
      "sequence": 16,
      "source_line": 50,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "自分だけのために書き記すなら<br>そんな技術使わなくていいのだから",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-13:51:27165307",
      "source_hash": "27165307",
      "sequence": 17,
      "source_line": 51,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "その人達はどんな想いで日々を生きていたのか",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-13:52:98dabb1e",
      "source_hash": "98dabb1e",
      "sequence": 18,
      "source_line": 52,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "僕たちは この同じ土地で<br>同じ空気を吸い 同じ水を飲み暮らしている",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-13:53:e987239d",
      "source_hash": "e987239d",
      "sequence": 19,
      "source_line": 53,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "違うのは 時間という軸のみ",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-13:54:2bbbfb22",
      "source_hash": "2bbbfb22",
      "sequence": 20,
      "source_line": 54,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "ルゼンハイド国民であるということは<br>一体どういうことなのか―――",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-13:55:fc2e2414",
      "source_hash": "fc2e2414",
      "sequence": 21,
      "source_line": 55,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "その答えは『時』の中にある",
